  "description": "Reid Blacktop 2.0 ST with Throttle | USA | Commuter eBike\nMid-drive power. Added throttle control.\nThe Reid Blacktop 2.0 ST with throttle is an electric commuter bike designed for everyday journeys and urban riding. Combining an Ananda mid-drive motor with Shimano 9-speed gearing, it offers versatile assistance for commuting, with the added convenience of a 300X speed lever throttle providing assistance up to 20 mph.\nHydraulic disc brakes provide controlled stopping power, while 2.1-inch semi-slick tyres offer grip and stability for everyday road riding in a range of weather conditions\nPractical accessories come fitted as standard, including mudguards, a rear rack and a heavy-duty rear stand. Ergonomic grips add comfort for regular journeys, making the Blacktop 2.0 ST with throttle a well-equipped option for commuting and getting around town\nThe Reid Blacktop 2.0 ST with throttle is ideal for:\n\nDaily commuting – Electric assistance for regular journeys to work and around town\n\nThrottle control – 300X speed lever providing assistance up to 20 mph\n\nVersatile riding – Shimano 9-speed gearing for a range of urban routes\n\nReliable braking – Hydraulic disc brakes for controlled stopping\n\nEveryday practicality – Mudguards and a rear rack fitted as standard\n\nConvenient parking – Heavy-duty rear stand for everyday use\n\nUrban road riding – 2.1-inch semi-slick tyres for grip and stability\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
